    "将删除全部 %lld 条截图及其图片、缩略图，此操作不可撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All %lld screenshots and their images/thumbnails will be deleted. This cannot be undone."
          }
