    "没有识别到文字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No text recognized"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有辨識到文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有这项权限，Cap 无法截取屏幕。请在系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 录屏与系统录音中勾选 Cap，然后回到这里点「重新检测」。\n\n截图只在本机处理，不联网、不上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cap can't capture the screen without this permission. Open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen Recording, enable Cap, then click “Check Again” here.\n\nScreenshots are processed only on this Mac; nothing is uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有這項權限，Cap 無法截取螢幕。請在系統設定 → 隱私權與安全性 → 螢幕錄製中勾選 Cap，然後回到這裡點「重新檢查」。\n\n截圖只在本機處理，不連網、不上傳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
